.TH VINMAIL 1 "2026" "vinmail 1.2.1" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
vinmail \- interactive terminal mail client for msmtp with multi-account and GPG support

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vinmail

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vinmail
is a lightweight, Bash-based terminal mail client built on top of msmtp.
It provides an interactive text-based interface for managing multiple
email accounts and composing, replying to, drafting, and sending mail
directly from the terminal.

Navigation is performed using arrow keys or j/k, Enter to select, and q to cancel.

.SH MENU OPTIONS
.TP
.B Switch active account
Set the active account by copying its configuration to ~/.msmtprc.

.TP
.B Add account
Launch a guided setup wizard. Press Esc at any prompt to abort, with confirmation.

.TP
.B Edit / Rename / Test
Modify account settings, update credentials, rename aliases, view configuration,
or test SMTP connectivity and authentication.

.TP
.B Delete account
Remove an account and its credentials. Requires typing 'yes' to confirm.

.TP
.B Compose & send mail
Open the full compose interface where To, Cc, Bcc, and Subject can be edited at
any time. The message body is written in $EDITOR. Supports file attachments,
optional GPG signing, and saving drafts.

.TP
.B Reply to mail
Reply to a previously received message by providing it as a .eml file. Parses
the original sender, subject, and Message-ID, builds proper In-Reply-To and
References headers, and quotes the original body. Supports reply-to-sender
and reply-all.

.TP
.B Drafts (n)
Browse, open, continue editing, or delete saved drafts. The count in
parentheses reflects the number of drafts currently saved.

.TP
.B Status
Display a table of all configured accounts along with their encryption status.

.SH COMPOSE KEYS
.TP
.B t
Edit recipient (To)

.TP
.B c
Edit Cc

.TP
.B b
Edit Bcc

.TP
.B s
Edit Subject

.TP
.B e
Open message body in $EDITOR

.TP
.B a
Manage attachments (add or remove files, supports tab completion for paths)

.TP
.B g
Toggle GPG signing and select signing key

.TP
.B d
Save the current message as a draft

.TP
.B y
Send message (with preview confirmation)

.TP
.B q
Discard or exit compose mode. If the draft was already saved, exits without
prompting.

.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/vinmail/accounts/<alias>.conf
Per-account msmtp configuration.

.TP
.I ~/.local/share/vinmail/accounts/<alias>.pass.gpg
GPG-encrypted password, when GPG encryption is selected.

.TP
.I ~/.local/share/vinmail/drafts/<name>.draft
Saved draft metadata (recipients, subject, GPG settings, attachment list).

.TP
.I ~/.local/share/vinmail/drafts/<name>.body
Saved draft message body, linked to its .draft file by matching name.

.TP
.I ~/.msmtprc
Active account configuration, used by msmtp.

